132
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:24,000
Rock magic!

133
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:26,000
Magic Cannon Flower!

134
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:30,000
Rock Fortress!

135
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:34,000
Oh, wow, Mimosa!

136
00:09:34,000 --> 00:09:37,000
