137
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:41,000
Asta, I'm going to get stronger.

138
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:45,000
The next time we face an enemy together, I'll be able to fight by your side!

139
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:50,000
